    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BlindSpell is an adventure draw-based game in which you have to guess what enemies you are fighting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569850/extras/7773a6c43699c2d2ee305e50feb66789.avif?t=1727679635\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Draw </strong>to cast spells and fight opponents!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569850/extras/7b081b1c17cbb9cf4864ad1c5774d22c.avif?t=1727679635\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Defend </strong>yourself from enemies' attacks!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569850/extras/ff5181d9561f1e960eede0741f80077d.poster.avif?t=1727679635\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569850/extras/ff5181d9561f1e960eede0741f80077d.webp?t=1727679635\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Unlock </strong>different upgrades to customize your spells!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569850/extras/314eb3fb28f6911d3755fb92a3975ad6.avif?t=1727679635\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Discover </strong>more about this universe, meet the elite of magic!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569850/extras/4d44d58430430089b8e7707fbbe0a147.avif?t=1727679635\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Become the master</strong> of elements and escape from the purgatory!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569850/extras/14cd3c77a7d81c89b7e4e0562d4a804a.avif?t=1727679635\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p></li></ul>",
